<programme start="20261129033100 +0000" stop="20261129041400 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Mayfair Witches</title><sub-title lang="en">Curiouser and Curiouser</sub-title><desc lang="en">At Deirdre&apos;s funeral, Rowan is plunged into the world of the infamous Mayfair family; Uncle Cortland and Aunt Carlotta present diverging views on Lasher; Rowan must choose whom to trust and face the dire consequences; Sip identifies Deirdre&apos;s killer.</desc><credits><actor>Alexandra Daddario</actor><actor>Jack Huston</actor><actor>Tongai Arnold Chirisa</actor></credits><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p23584602_i_h8_ag.jpg"/></programme>
