<programme start="20261129070000 +0000" stop="20261129080000 +0000" channel="CNN"><title lang="en">How It Really Happened</title><sub-title lang="en">Tylenol Murders: Killer Capsules</sub-title><desc lang="en">In 1982, seven Chicago-area residents are suddenly stricken with a deadly illness; although initially at a loss, doctors soon discover a sinister link, sparking a decades-long investigation.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13693571_b_h8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261129080000 +0000" stop="20261129090000 +0000" channel="CNN"><title lang="en">How It Really Happened</title><sub-title lang="en">Sante and Kenneth Kimes: The Missing Socialite</sub-title><desc lang="en">In 1998, mother-son duo Sante and Kenny Kimes became suspects in the high-profile case of a missing New York City socialite; the investigation reveals a trail of violence and fraud that spans from the Bahamas to Los Angeles.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13693571_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
