<programme start="20261128170000 +0000" stop="20261128173000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Free! Eternal Summer</title><sub-title lang="en">Stormy Dash-Dive!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Haruka and his friends have grown after last summer&apos;s tournament; amid the hustle and bustle of training for their individual events, their daily lives continue as usual.</desc><credits><actor>Greg Ayres</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>J. Tatum</actor><actor>Johnny Bosch</actor><actor>Todd Haberkorn</actor></credits><date>20140702</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/effe3b7fd44be1400cf38ae14ae459ed.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261128173000 +0000" stop="20261128180000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Free! Eternal Summer</title><sub-title lang="en">Stroke of an Unexpected Meeting!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The crew ponders how to attract new members to the Swim Club; Haruka is called in by Amakata-sensei to discuss his intended career path, but as always, Haruka moves to the beat of his own drum.</desc><credits><actor>Greg Ayres</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>J. Tatum</actor><actor>Johnny Bosch</actor><actor>Todd Haberkorn</actor></credits><date>20140709</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E02</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/effe3b7fd44be1400cf38ae14ae459ed.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261128180000 +0000" stop="20261128183000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Free! Eternal Summer</title><sub-title lang="en">The Butterfly of Farewell!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Iwatobi Festival has begun; Haruka and friends are fired up for the Club-versus-Club Relay Race, hoping to attract new members by putting in an impressive performance; meanwhile, Rei begins training.</desc><credits><actor>Greg Ayres</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>J. Tatum</actor><actor>Johnny Bosch</actor><actor>Todd Haberkorn</actor></credits><date>20140716</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/effe3b7fd44be1400cf38ae14ae459ed.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261128183000 +0000" stop="20261128190000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Free! Eternal Summer</title><sub-title lang="en">The Promise&apos;s Somersault Turn!</sub-title><desc lang="en">In anticipation of the upcoming prefectural tournament, the members of the Samezuka Swim Club enthusiastically show off their individual abilities; at the Iwatobi Swim Club, an equally enthusiastic Gou proposes a lunchbox inspection.</desc><credits><actor>Greg Ayres</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>J. Tatum</actor><actor>Johnny Bosch</actor><actor>Todd Haberkorn</actor></credits><date>20140723</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/effe3b7fd44be1400cf38ae14ae459ed.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261128190000 +0000" stop="20261128193000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Free! Eternal Summer</title><sub-title lang="en">A Resolution&apos;s Heads-Up!</sub-title><desc lang="en">The members of the Iwatobi Swim Club ponder over the cause of Nagisa&apos;s odd behavior at the end of practice that day; though they time their chance well to ask Nagisa what&apos;s happened, Nagisa stubbornly refuses to explain why he&apos;s upset.</desc><credits><actor>Greg Ayres</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>J. Tatum</actor><actor>Johnny Bosch</actor><actor>Todd Haberkorn</actor></credits><date>20140730</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/effe3b7fd44be1400cf38ae14ae459ed.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261128193000 +0000" stop="20261128200000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Free! Eternal Summer</title><sub-title lang="en">Invincible Prime!</sub-title><desc lang="en">On the eve of prefecturals, Makoto resolves himself to broach a certain subject with Haruka; as the tournament begins, the Iwatobi Swim Club is extremely enthusiastic about its prospects.</desc><credits><actor>Greg Ayres</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>J. Tatum</actor><actor>Johnny Bosch</actor><actor>Todd Haberkorn</actor></credits><date>20140810</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/effe3b7fd44be1400cf38ae14ae459ed.jpeg"/></programme>
