<programme start="20261128203000 +0000" stop="20261128210000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Free! Eternal Summer</title><sub-title lang="en">The Locomotive of a Twist!</sub-title><desc lang="en">While Haruka and the boys redouble their training in the wake of prefecturals, Makoto notices Gou looking troubled and asks her what&apos;s wrong; she tells him that Coach Sasabe has been busy with his Swim Club lately.</desc><credits><actor>Greg Ayres</actor><actor>Ian Sinclair</actor><actor>J. Tatum</actor><actor>Johnny Bosch</actor><actor>Todd Haberkorn</actor></credits><date>20140820</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.7.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E08</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/effe3b7fd44be1400cf38ae14ae459ed.jpeg"/></programme>
