<programme start="20261127160000 +0000" stop="20261127180000 +0000" channel="ESPN 2 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Battle 4 Atlantis, Signature Series: Virginia vs. Xavier</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 2 Virginia Cavaliers meet the Xavier Musketeers at Imperial Arena in the Battle 4 Atlantis. Unbeaten Virginia enters at 8-0 after defeating Marquette 60-54, while 6-1 Xavier arrives after beating Texas A&amp;M 88-83 in the Bahamas.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261127180000 +0000" stop="20261127200000 +0000" channel="ESPN 2 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Players Era Sixteen: Iowa State vs. St. John&apos;s</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 13 St. John&apos;s Red Storm (6-1) and the Iowa State Cyclones (4-2) meet in the Players Era 16 tournament at Michelob ULTRA Arena. St. John&apos;s broke their six-game win streak and fell to Louisville 93-90, while Iowa State lost to Tennessee 75-64.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
