<programme start="20261127220000 +0000" stop="20261128000000 +0000" channel="ESPN 2 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Villanova at Kansas</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 12 Kansas Jayhawks (6-1) face the Villanova Wildcats (5-2) at Allen Fieldhouse in Lawrence. Villanova enters on a two-game win streak after beating Coppin State 70-52, while Kansas beat Denver 84-67 behind Trey Kaufman-Renn.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
